{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadscore\/playeradapter\/sourceurl"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Optional: the URL this adapter is currently playing — the ASSET, not a surface."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore\/PlayerAdapter\/sourceUrl","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sourceUrl"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"? { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK lends the content player to an ad on the shared-element path (the ad plays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through the content player so it reaches the layer system picture-in-picture is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"presenting) and has to give it back afterwards. Only the adapter knows what to give"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"back, and it must read that from the PLAYER rather than remember what was passed to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"load(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":": integrators legitimately call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"replaceCurrentItem"},{"type":"text","text":" themselves — the demo"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does — so an adapter tracking only its own calls would report the wrong asset, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"none."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineCon